HOW TO GET A COMMERCIAL LICENSE:
 
1. Email: info@pi360.org
2. Subject: "Commercial License Request - [Your Company]"
3. Tell us: Company name, intended use, commercial value, timeline
4. Negotiate: PI360 proposes licensing terms
5. License options:
   - Flat fee license (one-time)
   - Royalty-based license (% of revenue)
   - Subscription license (annual)
   - Custom restricted license
 
TYPICAL COMMERCIAL LICENSE FEES (Examples only):
 
Small Business (< 100k revenue): EUR 2,000 - EUR 5,000
Medium Business (100k - 1M): EUR 5,000 - EUR 25,000 or 5-10% royalty
Enterprise (> 1M): Custom negotiation, typically 5-15% royalty
SaaS Competitors: EUR 50,000+ or 15-20% royalty
 
Note: Actual fees depend on scope, commercial value, territory, and exclusivity.
 
BENEFIT: License revenue funds PI360's research, education, and community work.
 
