A: YES under CC BY-SA 4.0, but modifications stay CC BY-SA 4.0
   (non-commercial only)
 
Q: Can I teach SPDL for free?
A: YES - education is non-commercial
   But charging for training requires Commercial License
 
Q: What counts as "commercial"?
A: Anything where someone pays for a product/service based on SPDL
 
Q: How much does Commercial License cost?
A: Contact licensing@pi360.org for quote (depends on use case)
 
